<h1>Extraction</h1>
<p>A shot is a recipe: a dose of ground coffee in, a weight of espresso out, in a time. Our house recipe is 18 g in, 36 g out, in 28 seconds.</p>
<p>Weigh both every time. A shot that tastes wrong is a recipe that changed, and the scale tells you which part.</p>
